    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-105219",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-04T17:09:54.186Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-04T17:09:54.186Z",
      "description": "Mammoth.js 1.3.0 before 1.12.3 contains a regular expression denial of service vulnerability in the style map tokeniser in lib/styles/parser/tokeniser.js due to overlapping regex alternatives. Attackers can supply a crafted .docx with an unterminated quoted string of repeated backslash escapes in mammoth/style-map to block the Node.js event loop.",
      "severity": 7.5,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：mwilliamson mammoth.js\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/mwilliamson/mammoth.js/issues/487",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
